{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Car Rental Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3701180,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701180/extras/cd8d5d789cba2790f701ece40e6f5d01.avif?t=1750765805\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span><strong>Car Rental Simulator</strong> is a detailed and immersive management game where every decision counts. You'll take control of a real working car rental operation \u2014 handling daily tasks like checking in customers, maintaining vehicles, managing returns, and expanding services as demand grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This simulator isn't just about running a parking lot \u2014 it\u2019s about organizing, planning, and thinking ahead. Each in-game day presents new scenarios that require strategy, time management, and smart decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With deep systems, evolving challenges, and randomized events, <strong>Car Rental Simulator offers high replayability</strong>, rewarding both casual players and those who love perfecting their process.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701180/extras/cd8d5d789cba2790f701ece40e6f5d01.avif?t=1750765805\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span><strong>Car Rental Simulator</strong> is a detailed and immersive management game where every decision counts. You'll take control of a real working car rental operation \u2014 handling daily tasks like checking in customers, maintaining vehicles, managing returns, and expanding services as demand grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This simulator isn't just about running a parking lot \u2014 it\u2019s about organizing, planning, and thinking ahead. Each in-game day presents new scenarios that require strategy, time management, and smart decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With deep systems, evolving challenges, and randomized events, <strong>Car Rental Simulator offers high replayability</strong>, rewarding both casual players and those who love perfecting their process.</p>",
    "short_description": "Run your own car rental lot in this detailed simulator. Manage reservations, clean and service vehicles, and keep customers happy. With time-based tasks, strategy elements, and high replayability, every day brings a new challenge.",
